1
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,720
THE CHARACTERS, BEHAVIORS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, PROFESSIONS,

2
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,800
AND VARIOUS INCIDENTS IN THIS SERIES
ARE ENTIRELY FICTIONAL,

3
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:21,880
CREATED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY,
WITHOUT ANY INTENTION TO REFERENCE

4
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,960
OR ENCOURAGE ANY ACTIONS
THAT MAY OCCUR IN REALITY.

5
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,040
PLEASE USE DISCRETION WHEN VIEWING

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:04,160
Hey, wait! Easy, it's me, it's me!

7
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,880
Wait.
Promise me,

8
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,800
if I let go, you won't scream, okay?

9
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,280
I need to talk to you.

10
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,680
About what?

11
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,240
About Pan.

12
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,040
What is it?

13
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,960
Are you going to turn me in to the police?

14
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,680
No, no, no.

15
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,840
I came to confess the truth

16
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,440
before I lose my chance to speak.

17
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,160
About what?

18
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,720
Pan was pregnant.

19
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,880
I know.

20
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,480
You know?

21
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,040
So me,

22
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,760
Chee, Joe, M,

23
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,680
we don't know who the father is.

24
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,680
What do you mean?

25
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,440
I mean exactly what I said.

26
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,880
So you all conspired to kill my sister,
didn't you?

27
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,960
No. No, no, no.

28
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:19,040
We didn't do it.
Chee did it!

29
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,480
-Hey!
-So what?

30
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,800
So what?

31
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,640
Why do you treat me like this?

32
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,200
Just get rid of it.

33
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,800
Hey, that's a whole-ass human being!

34
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,880
I'm pregnant, you know!

35
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,960
Then get rid of it.

36
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,240
Get rid of it?

37
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,680
Yeah. The fuck's the big deal?

38
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,440
Why are you talking
like such a piece of shit?

39
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,800
Just go get an abortion.

40
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,760
Don't you walk away from me,
you son of a faggot!

41
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,600
Faggot?

42
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,000
Why did you tell me?

43
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,080
So right now, Tang is hunting me down,

44
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,600
and on top of that,
someone is trying to kill us too.

45
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:37,960
I…

46
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,400
Here.

47
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,080
Dig.

48
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,160
Chee did it alone.

49
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,800
He smashed Paan's head with a rock,
then buried her near the forest.

50
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,080
Close to a boulder.

51
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,120
Chawin knew. Tang knew.

52
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,520
The two of them covered it up together!

53
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,680
So why are you telling me?

54
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:41,160
Because right now Tang is hunting me down

55
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:43,320
and on top of that,
someone is trying to kill me.

56
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,280
I've been here for two days.
Haven't eaten anything.

57
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,160
Jeans said she'd bring me food
and never showed.

58
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:50,600
I can't take this anymore!

59
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,240
Can you find a cop named Som for me?

60
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:55,880
She's the only one who can protect me.

61
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,200
And then what?

62
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,920
I'm begging you.

63
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,480
Please.

64
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,680
Find the cop named Som

65
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,040
and I'll turn myself in.

66
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:10,120
I'll turn myself in
and I'll tell everyone the whole truth!

67
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,560
Please?

68
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,040
You see…

69
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,280
There is someone suspicious though.

70
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,840
Jeans.

71
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,320
A big sum of money?

72
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,640
10 million.

73
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,040
If you had the chance to get it,

74
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,400
would you take it?

75
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,320
Ever since she moved here,
more people have been dying.

76
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,440
What do you think?

77
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,760
You know, if we actually find the killer,

78
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,920
Chawin's offering 10 million.

79
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,680
10 million.

80
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,720
10 million.

81
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,960
You want it?

82
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,280
Who wouldn't?

83
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,000
Don't you want it?

84
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,880
I wasn't really thinking about that

85
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,120
but if you want it,

86
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,520
I can help.

87
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,520
Hey!

88
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,200
There was someone who was dying for ages.

89
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,800
You lot covered it up together.

90
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:54,800
And Jeans?

91
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,440
I know Jeans has been trying to help you,
hasn't she?

92
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:02,280
Honestly?

93
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,440
Jeans has been setting things up,

94
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:05,920
framing you.

95
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,560
I'm telling you the whole truth right now

96
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,880
so you'll trust me.

97
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,960
She's the one who staged it
to make me kill M,

98
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,960
then pin it all on you
for the reward money!

99
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,040
M?

100
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,160
Why did you kill M?

101
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:37,400
I didn't do it. I didn't do it.
I don't know anything.

102
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:40,000
Jeans, I genuinely don't know anything.

103
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:43,360
I didn't do it!

104
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,480
Jeans.

105
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:51,680
Last night I was with you
the whole night, wasn't I?

106
00:11:56,400 --> 00:12:01,160
Jeans, last night,
don't you remember I was with you?

107
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,760
I was with Nai all night.

108
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,680
Nai can confirm that.

109
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:08,080
Why are you saying that, Jeans?

110
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,800
That's not true.

111
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:20,920
That's not true.

112
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,600
You can fool other people.

113
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,280
But you can't fool yourself.

114
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:57,520
Som,

115
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:58,920
can you come? Please.

116
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,000
Hey.

117
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,080
You just vanished on me.

118
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,400
Hump and dump?

119
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,480
Hump and dump my ass.

120
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,120
I've been waiting here for two days.

121
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,800
The cops showed up at the shop.

122
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,360
What, you want them to follow me here too?

123
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,240
Did anyone tail you?

124
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,480
You think?

125
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:15,560
Nai said Pan's body
was buried near a boulder.

126
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,960
I've been looking for a while now
there's not a single boulder here.

127
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,680
Are you sure Nai wasn't lying?

128
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,000
I don't know.

129
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,040
Looking at the ground here,
this area must have flooded at some point.

130
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:38,600
Is it possible

131
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:41,240
the boulder got submerged?

132
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:44,760
Get me a shovel.

133
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:18,640
This is…

134
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,920
the necklace mom gave to Pan.

135
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,840
She never took it off.

136
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,880
But we've dug this deep
and there's no body.

137
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,440
That means the body's been moved.

138
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:43,120
Who else is connected
to both Pan and Chee?

139
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,080
So…

140
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,320
we're on the same page now, right?

141
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,440
Yeah.

142
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,160
Sorry.

143
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,560
Guess it's not just food
you're hungry for.

144
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,640
I mean…

145
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,120
I don't know.

146
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:33,720
Hold on.

147
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,200
Condom.

148
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Ugh,

149
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:40,720
we didn't use one last time either.

150
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,280
No way.

151
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:45,800
I've got one under my bike seat.

152
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,520
Okay, okay.

153
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,200
Blue-balled the vibe.

154
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:22,280
Found him.

155
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,800
I can't stall for long.

156
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,640
Get here fast, Inspector.

157
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,680
Why do you think it's Jeans?

158
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:38,760
You see…

159
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,640
I saw Chee's finger at Jeans's house.

160
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,840
How do you know it was Chee's finger?

161
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:00,080
And was it the same hand?

162
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,720
I'm pretty sure it was Chee's finger.

163
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,840
Because I compared it to a photo.

164
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,240
And in this whole district,

165
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,520
the only person skilled
with a knife is Jeans.

166
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,160
Hello, Sergeant.

167
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,600
We're on the way, Lieutenant.

168
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:22,880
Keep an eye on the inspector.
Don't let him do anything stupid.

169
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:23,960
Yes, ma'am.

170
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,000
Drive.

171
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,680
Get in the car, Pin.

172
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,280
Que.

173
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,240
Do you remember, Uncle?

174
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:04,840
You once told me

175
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,640
you'd leave everything to me.

176
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,640
Mm.

177
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,000
Please sign here.

178
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,280
Once the drug kicks in,

179
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:31,360
you'll start losing strength gradually

180
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,440
and

181
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,040
you won't be able to move at all.

182
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:46,320
Sign it!

183
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,480
Very good.

184
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:08,400
Why are you doing this to me?

185
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,760
I love you very much, Uncle.

186
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:13,000
But right now,

187
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:15,600
I think you no longer deserve
to go on living.

188
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:19,960
There's someone…

189
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,800
who wants you dead more than anything.

190
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:33,200
Die, you bastard.

191
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,000
What the hell?

192
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,880
Why do you have a knife, Jeans?

193
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:36,120
Someone help!

194
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:37,720
Are you insane? Hey!

195
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,480
Please don't you do anything to me!

196
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,520
Caught red-handed,
you bastard!

197
00:22:42,600 --> 00:22:44,400
-Get up.
-Easy, Inspector.

198
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,760
-Help me!
-Get down!

199
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:47,640
-Come here!
-Easy, Inspector.

200
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:51,360
Stay out of it!

201
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:01,400
Stay right here, don't move!

202
00:23:20,800 --> 00:23:22,760
What the hell is your problem with me?

203
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:33,200
I'm pinning my officer's shooting on you!

204
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,680
You bastard!

205
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,560
I can close the Chee case too.

206
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:39,080
Become a scapegoat and die

207
00:23:41,360 --> 00:23:43,480
I'll just put you down right here.

208
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:22,400
You bitch,
you set me up?

209
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,520
-Move!
-You set me up?

210
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:25,920
-Take him up.
-Lieutenant!

211
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:28,520
She's the one behind all of this!

212
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,280
She planned the whole thing!

213
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:31,360
Hold on.

214
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:33,080
Police.

215
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:34,160
Officer.

216
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:35,560
Catch him.

217
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:37,560
If Nai killed M…

218
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:40,360
then who killed Chee and Jo?

219
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,560
People that rotten

220
00:24:44,040 --> 00:24:45,560
have no shortage of enemies.

221
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,760
Who could possibly know?

222
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:06,400
Even when my memories of the past
finally came back,

223
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,720
there were only more questions

224
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:11,200
what really happened to me,

225
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:14,240
what truly happened to Pan
all those years ago.

226
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:15,680
Even now,

227
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:18,040
Even now,
I still can't find an answer for myself.

228
00:25:18,120 --> 00:25:19,640
So, Mr. Thanakorn.

229
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,040
Will you admit

230
00:25:21,120 --> 00:25:23,520
to killing M, Chee, and Jo?

231
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:28,200
Today, the truth about Pan buried
for over three years

232
00:25:28,280 --> 00:25:29,560
has finally come to light.

233
00:25:29,840 --> 00:25:33,800
It's a cold tragedy carried out
by humans to other humans.

234
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:35,520
Everyone who wronged Pan

235
00:25:35,600 --> 00:25:38,080
met the same fate.

236
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:41,440
I admit to killing M. But Chee and Jo?
That wasn't me!

237
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,800
The evidence is sitting
right in front of you!

238
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:45,520
-I'm telling you, I didn't do it!
-Show me whatever evidence you've got!

239
00:25:45,600 --> 00:25:47,240
-Hey, just admit it already.
-I didn't do it!

240
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:51,880
Chee, Jo, M, all dead and gone.

241
00:25:52,120 --> 00:25:53,880
Inspector Tang was killed
in a police shooting

242
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:56,600
in the case of the hired murder
of Teacher Sumet.

243
00:25:57,200 --> 00:26:00,840
Chawin was poisoned,
with evidence linking Nai to the plot.

244
00:26:01,040 --> 00:26:03,840
Nai became a suspect
in the murders of M and Chawin.

245
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:06,720
sentenced to pay
for his crimes behind bars.

246
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:26,680
Jeans walked free of every charge.

247
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:29,600
She became the only person
who stood by my side

248
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:32,840
amid all the evil people in this town.

249
00:26:35,120 --> 00:26:38,840
And though everyone got
what they deserved,

250
00:26:39,280 --> 00:26:41,960
one thing remains a mystery

251
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:46,160
Pan's body,
which vanished without a trace.

252
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,640
No one knows.

253
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:49,920
And perhaps no one
truly wants to find out.

254
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:53,240
Today, Wariprasop
has gone quiet again

255
00:26:53,320 --> 00:26:57,720
as though nothing ever happened here.

256
00:26:58,680 --> 00:26:59,960
So what's next for you?

257
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,680
Who knows.

258
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:05,040
At least I should get a promotion
out of this.

259
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:10,000
In the end, nobody got the reward money.

260
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,440
Pin, let's go sing karaoke.

261
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,000
Go ahead first.

262
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:29,120
Do you think this is really over?

263
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,240
Who knows.

264
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,240
Aren't you going with your girlfriend?

265
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:40,240
What girlfriend?

266
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:42,680
What? Isn't she?

267
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:46,920
You're singing the next song.

268
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:48,720
Mm.

269
00:29:11,600 --> 00:29:14,280
Get in.

270
00:29:15,080 --> 00:29:16,080
Get in.

271
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:31,720
You're the officer
in charge of the case, right?

272
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:33,960
Yes.

273
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:36,560
I'm Chawin's nephew.

274
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:40,360
You're the one who caught the killer, yes?

275
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,720
Yes.

276
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:46,240
I came to do what my uncle promised.

277
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:06,520
How did you let
something like this happen?

278
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:09,440
I don't know.

279
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:11,240
All I know is this is our baby too.

280
00:30:13,320 --> 00:30:14,320
Is it though?

281
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:17,520
Of course it is.

282
00:30:17,600 --> 00:30:19,040
I'm not ready to have a child right now.

283
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:21,560
Why are you talking
like such a piece of shit?

284
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,800
You're just a slut.

285
00:30:24,040 --> 00:30:26,160
How dare you say something like that,
you bastard?

286
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:28,240
Enough, Som.

287
00:31:43,040 --> 00:31:44,160
Not asleep yet, Mom?

288
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,680
Mm.

289
00:31:46,080 --> 00:31:47,480
Just heading to bed.

290
00:31:48,120 --> 00:31:49,440
Don't stay up too late either.

291
00:32:02,360 --> 00:32:03,400
Mom.

292
00:32:07,520 --> 00:32:08,520
Goodnight.

293
00:32:11,520 --> 00:32:12,520
Mm.

294
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:16,960
Hey!

295
00:36:17,720 --> 00:36:18,800
Police!

296
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:42,000
May I enter?

297
00:36:42,240 --> 00:36:43,400
The curry is hot.

298
00:36:45,520 --> 00:36:48,320
Before you go,
have a taste of my curry.

299
00:36:50,600 --> 00:36:51,600
Please?

300
00:38:38,200 --> 00:38:39,360
Mom.

301
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:41,720
Are you tired?

302
00:38:43,040 --> 00:38:44,360
If you are,

303
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:47,640
you can stop, you know?

304
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:51,120
I'm not tired.

305
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:55,120
I'll do whatever it takes for you.

306
00:38:57,800 --> 00:39:00,320
They will all face the consequences
of what they've done.

307
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:03,760
Rest now, my child.
